      "created_at": "2012-03-15T09:05:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My interpretation is that even if Stealth is “on”, Wraith will still take the 1 or 2 or any number of irreducible damage.</p>\n<p>“Entirely” refers to cards such as Blade’s Elemental Redistributor and Legacy’s Danger Sense.</p>",
