      "created_at": "2012-03-15T13:22:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When the rules state to prevent damage entirely, I think it literally means that.  The card has to say in some effect as prevent the next damage (no numeric modifier here) or prevent all damage or prevent damage (possibly of a certain type).  Basically something that would have the same effect as if it were to say immune.</p>",
